### Create an employee
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Prasad",
  "age": 28,
  "salary": 60000,
  "department": "IT"
}

### Get all employees
GET http://localhost:8080/employees

### Update an employee
PUT http://localhost:8080/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Prasad",
  "age": 28,
  "salary": 70000,
  "department": "Engineering"
}

### Delete an employee
DELETE http://localhost:8080/employees/1